This one, OTOH, seems to have been your fault completely. Waking up
nymphs is a beginner mistake. And if they were already awake (in case
of bones levels, e.g.) you should prefer to flee and/or use Elbereth
(as suggested by the previous poster) to clean that level in a more
controlled way. Mind that you can always come back later to the level
in case you flee. And don't melee with nymphs (if you've not yet a
weapon with sufficiently high damage), apply ranged attacks instead.

